  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">NORDEM - support to Sahel Panel Addendum</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Issoufou-panel was formally launched by the UN in 2022 to provide analysis of the situation in the SAHEL area and make suggestions for international presence and solutions to the complex security situation. Norway will support the panel with secondments of 3 persons and funding of some program activities. The agreement/support will end by 2023. NORDEM will be the implementing partner. The total support is 8 870 014NOK.</narrative>
  </description>
